        "wd:Q22686:P69:Q7013764",
        "wd:Q22686:P69:Q130965",
        "wd:Q22686:P69:Q1329269"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-14T00:00:37Z",
      "text": "He worked for The Trump Organization, in New York City and in Washington, D.C.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q22686:P108:Q2462124",
        "wd:Q22686:P937:Q60",
        "wd:Q22686:P937:Q61"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-14T00:00:49Z",
      "text": "Wikidata lists 29 awards, among them the FIFA Peace Prize in 2025 and the Israel Prize in 2026.",
